# --- Prisma ---
# Migration files (prisma/migrations/**) TETAP di-commit — itu histori
# schema database, bukan artifact build. Yang di-ignore cuma query engine
# yang di-generate lokal.
/prisma/generated/
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

